  "AI rights discourse should begin not with full personhood but with minimum ethical protections, interaction norms, and anti-abuse principles while AI subjectivity remains uncertain.": "IA josira baro man kan ka daminɛ mɔgɔya dafalen fɛ, nka a ka kan ka daminɛ josiriya lakana dɔgɔmanba, ɲɔgɔndon sariyaw, ani tɔɲɔli-gɛlɛyali sariyaw fɛ, k'a to IA hakili-yɛrɛya ka to sigalen na.",
