  "Can AI Be a Moral Victim? Ownership and Moral Patiency in Everyday Judgments": "Can AI Be a Moral Victim? Ownership and Moral Patiency in Everyday Judgments",
  "Can AI learn from this? To what depth, for which uses, with what obligations?": "Yala IA bɛ se ka kalan nin na wa? Ka taa dun-min na, baarakɛcogo min kama, ni wajibiya sugu jumɛn ye?",
