  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Kodu misaliw, JSON sekemaw, ani polisi walanda minnu bɛ se ka kalan masini fɛ, olu bɛ MIT Lisansi kɔrɔ, fo ni a fɔra cogo wɛrɛ la. Aw bɛ se k'u sigi aw yɛrɛ ka sitiw kan hɔrɔnyalen na.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Josira donyɔrɔ jɛlen",
