  "Commercial use": "Jago Kɛli",
  "Commercial use requires contact": "Jago kɛli ɲini ka kuma",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Bletchley IA Lakana Sanya kɔfɛ, Yoshua Bengio ye ɲɛmɔgɔ ye ni dɔnnibaba 100 ni kɔ ye, minnu bɔra jamana bisaba dama ni UN, OECD ani EU la, kunnafoni yɛrɛmahɔrɔnyalen in bɛ dɛmɛnfɛn dɔnniyaw jɛ ɲɔgɔn na, IA fɔlɔfɔlɔ sebagaya ni faratiw kan — k'a jira ko sisitɛmu dɔw bɛ se ka a dɔn tuma min na u bɛ sɛgɛsɛgɛ, wa u bɛ u yɛrɛ ka kɛtaw yɛlɛma o kɔrɔ.",
  "Companion media": "Baara-ɲɔgɔn media",
